  objectName: SPECTRUM ANALYZER
  objectDescription: "<color=#8AB4F8>\u2022 Freq Range: 2 Hz to 85 GHz\n\u2022 Real-time
    BW: Up to 2 GHz\n\u2022 Noise Level: -172 dBm\n\u2022 5G NR & mmWave Ready\n\u2022
    Status: <color=#00FF00>SYNCHRONIZED</color></color>\n\n<color=#E0E0E0><size=80%><b>OVERVIEW:</b>\nThe
    absolute backbone of our RF laboratory. This high-precision analyzer is currently
    scanning the ambient 5G millimeter-wave spectrum.\n\n<b>CURRENT LAB TASK:</b>\nEngineers
    are utilizing it to hunt down elusive micro-interference in the 28 GHz band,
    ensuring ultra-low latency and flawless beamforming for the experimental smart-city
    network.</size></color>"
